@startuml
' Charging for a page view: the grant is recorded without waiting for the
' chain to agree. Source for public/assets/img/two-orderings-charge-*.png.
!include style.iuml
$lifelines()

B -> S : POST the article
S -> D : lock this wallet; is there a grant?
D --> S : no grant
S -> C : send the charge\n(the server signs it)
S -> C : poll the signature, up to 20 s

alt confirmed
  S -> D : record the grant
  S --> B : the article
else no answer in 20 s
  S -> D : record the grant anyway
  S --> B : the article, and a line saying\nthe confirmation did not arrive
else landed and failed
  S --> B : why the charge failed\n(nothing recorded)
end

note over S, D
  The grant is written before the page is built.
  If building the page fails, the next POST
  finds the grant and charges nothing.
end note
@enduml
